# Prototype design rules

## Direction
Industrial, precise, engineered, established, dependable. Premium but not luxurious. Modern without startup-SaaS aesthetics.

## Reject
- Purple/cream AI-template palettes
- Generic shadcn/Tailwind defaults unchanged
- Luxury editorial or fashion layouts
- Vague marketing copy ("unlock", "seamless", "revolutionary")
- Decorative filler sections with no task purpose

## Require
- Task-first homepage (products, calculator, submittal, distributors, support)
- Realistic manufacturer content density
- Readable data tables and document rows
- Intentional radius, shadow, border, and spacing from `design/design-tokens.json`
- Mobile navigation and data-table alternatives
- Footer disclaimer on all prototype pages

## Components
Build under `components/prototype/` using approved tokens. Design-system route must showcase all control types before full pages.

## Content
Use `design/prototype-copy.md`. No fabricated stats, testimonials, or client logos. Label demo data clearly.
